  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Resources, Reforms, and Results: what do on-the-ground decision-makers want and how can German development cooperation best support them?</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resources, Reforms, and Results: what do on-the-ground decision-makers want and how can German development cooperation best support them?</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Durch die Evaluierung des Forschungslabors AidData, angesiedelt am College of William and Mary, in Zusammenarbeit mit dem DEval, soll herausgearbeitet werden, wie die deutsche Entwicklungszusammenarbeit aus Sicht der Partnerl&#xe4;nder wahrgenommen wird.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation of the research lab AidData, settled at the college of William and Mary, in co-operation with DEval, shall show how the German development cooperation is noticed from a partner perspective.</narrative>
  </description>
